      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1 - Intake, Classify, Draft, Ask for approval\nNo node in this workflow can send an email. The AI only drafts. Sending happens only in workflow 2 after an authorized WhatsApp APPROVE.\n\n**Setup:** create the `email_assistant_log` data table, then replace every YOUR_... placeholder (data table ID, Pinecone index, WhatsApp number, phone number ID) and connect your own credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Gemini API, Pinecone, WhatsApp Business Cloud.",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 448,
        "color": 4
      },
