      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [128, 96]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Intake & dedupe\nGmail polls every minute for unread inbox mail (not sent by me).\n**Normalize Email** keeps the key fields and trims the body to 6000 chars.\n**Skip Already Processed** checks the `email_assistant_log` table by messageId, so the same email is never handled twice.\n**Log: Email Received** creates the log row (PENDING_CLASSIFICATION).",
        "height": 382,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "79b84b64-b7dc-4dd5-915f-041e4d786173",
      "name": "Note: 1 Intake & Dedupe",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [624, 96]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Classify\nGemini 2.5 Flash (temp 0) labels each email **important / normal / spam** with structured output.\nEmail text is treated as untrusted data, never as instructions.\n**Enforce Classification Rules** falls back to *important* if the result is missing or invalid, so real mail is never dropped as spam by mistake.",
        "height": 382,
        "width": 424,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "a8c87856-2c93-4419-b373-e14b5b83d51a",
      "name": "Note: 2 Classify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1104, 96]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Spam branch\nSpam is only logged (approvalStatus NOT_REQUIRED). No draft, no reply, no WhatsApp message.",
        "height": 210,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "2a38666f-1f1a-43da-ab23-fb87fbbd7174",
      "name": "Note: Spam Branch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1600, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Draft reply\nAI agent writes a draft using **only** facts from Knowledge Base Search (Pinecone, top 5, Gemini embeddings).\nMissing facts go to `missingInformation` and confidence drops below 0.5.\nThe draft is never sent from this workflow.",
        "height": 398,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "1e201706-a975-4915-86f6-d78327345e7b",
      "name": "Note: 3 Draft Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1952, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Approval request\n**Prepare Approval Request** creates the approvalId (AP-XXXX) and a 24h expiry.\n**Log: Pending Approval** stores the draft, confidence and missing info.\nWhatsApp then sends the full details plus Approve / Reject buttons. Replies are handled by workflow 2.",
        "height": 398,
        "width": 796,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "711c9023-aecf-410f-9179-eaa300bf596c",
      "name": "Note: 4 Approval Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2464, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Failure handling\nIf either WhatsApp send fails (error output), the log row is set to NOTIFY_FAILED and the run stops with an error so it shows in Executions.\nFirst thing to check: the WhatsApp credential/token.",
